+    "implication": "0.08 appears THREE times across five weeks and 0.12 appears ONCE, so 0.12 is plausibly variance around a 0.08 level and the standing gate ('beat our best prior submitted run') is anchored to an OUTLIER. The score has been FLAT at 0.08 from 2026-06-21 through 2026-07-16 despite substantial work in between. Directly relevant to this pre-flight: if five weeks of work did not move the leaderboard off 0.08, an offline delta small enough to need >=6 discordant cells to detect would not be detectable on the leaderboard at all.",
