+      "why_it_is_doubly_anchored": "the first clause is anchored to the MODAL score (0.08, seen three times) and the second to the SINGLE-OBSERVATION maximum (0.12). If 0.12 is variance around a 0.08 level, the second clause asks a new run to beat a lucky draw rather than to beat the system's actual level -- so it can be failed by a genuine improvement and passed by noise."
